BT 0.85 0.90 0.95 rg /F2 8.5 Tf 62 377.5 Td (Answer: 'I architected a modular, registry-driven tool suite. On route mount \(/user/tools\), the client calls) Tj ET
BT 0.85 0.90 0.95 rg /F2 8.5 Tf 62 364.5 Td (GET /api/users/tools-suite. Because backend queries often return denormalized duplicate rows, I implemented a) Tj ET
BT 0.85 0.90 0.95 rg /F2 8.5 Tf 62 351.5 Td (client-side Map aggregation to deduplicate categories by toolId and compute real-time tool counts. Clicking a) Tj ET
BT 0.85 0.90 0.95 rg /F2 8.5 Tf 62 338.5 Td (category folder opens a lazy-loaded modal that queries sub-tools dynamically. Clicking any tool navigates to) Tj ET
BT 0.85 0.90 0.95 rg /F2 8.5 Tf 62 325.5 Td (/user/tools/:toolSlug, which mounts the dedicated tool controller wrapped in a unified layout shell with) Tj ET
BT 0.85 0.90 0.95 rg /F2 8.5 Tf 62 312.5 Td (breadcrumbs. This separation ensures zero coupling between individual tool implementations.') Tj ET
